  "ui.about.aSet": "A set, on your phone",
  "ui.about.aSetText": "At an event run on Smashy, every set has its own page. Both players strike stages there and report the score; the organizer confirms it, and the bracket moves on by itself. This is what it looks like (the players are made up):",
